DS Bot (DeepSeek-Bot)
Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright 2026 Fei2411 and the DS Bot contributors

  - lib/core/rooms.js ports the room of ds-bot/src/host/groups.js and
    roster.js: who answers in a group, @-mentions, the member prompt and the
    group's view.
  - lib/rooms.js ports the room runtime of ds-bot/src/host/groups.js: the relay
    of members' turns, calling back whoever gave the work once it is done, idle
    relays that stop, and a member's late reply starting a new round.
  - lib/core/goals.js follows the group goal of ds-bot/src/host/goals.js:
    stages with acceptance, passing, sending back, and nudging the admin.
  - lib/core/dsBotImport.js reads the team DS Bot saves (its state.json,
    capability and memory formats as in ds-bot/src/host/store.js, roster.js,
    capabilities.js and memory.js) to import it into VsSaros Bots; it copies no
    DS Bot code.

